== Usage ==
[[File:Sepulchre of Dragrimmar map getting there.jpg|thumb|Drakkar Lake route]]
* Use alcohol avoid getting KDed by Irrestible Blow or run really fast to the entrance.
* Avoid Ice Darts at all costs.
* Use Death's Charge if you get bodyblocked, need healing, or to speed up the run.
* Maintain Dark Escape with Dwarven Stability.
* Maintain Shroud of Distress as needed.

=== Level 1 ===
[[File:Sepulchre of Dragrimmar map level 1.jpg|thumb|Level 1 route]]
* Open the gate by stepping on the switch, avoid the Ice Darts.
* Head through the door to the North and run to the next switch.
* Try to avoid the [[gww:Whirling_Wisp|Whirling Wisps]] while running and casting spells.  They use [[gww:Lyssa%27s_Assault|Lyssa's Assault]] which will interrupt you.
* Run through the Northeast opening and turn left at the split and head to the switch (at point 2 on the map).
* Step on the switch.
* Turn around and head back towards where you came from and continue straight through towards point 3 on the map.
* Step on the switch then head back towards the second switch.
* Continue past point 2 on the map to the gate to level 2.

=== Level 2 ===
[[File:Sepsafespot.jpg|thumb|The safe spot for avoiding Diamondshard Mist.]]
* Make your way to the boss room.
* Before going into the room, walk sideways or backwards to maintain the aggro of the Ice Imps and Dryders.  Pull them into the room.
* Round up aggro and kill all the [[gww:Avalanche|Avalanches]] before continuing.  They use [[gww:Frozen_Burst|Frozen Burst]] which can hit you through Shadow Form.
* Walking backwards or sideways, take your aggro and head to the right side of the boss. There is a bug where [[gww:Diamondshard_Mist|Diamondshard Mist]] won't take effect in that area.
* Ebon Battle Standard of Honor -> Sliver Armor to kill the [[gww:Remnant_of_Antiquities|Remnant of Antiquities]].
** If you can get the cycle, you can use Glyph of Swiftness -> Shadow Form -> Sliver Armor -> Ebon Battle Standard of Honor.  This will reduce the recharge time of Sliver Armor by 25% as well.
* Stay on the very outside range of Sliver Armor.  The boss tends not to use Frozen Burst there.  Be sure to not leave the safe spot.
* Collect chest and kill the remaining elementals if running people.

== Counters ==
* Rubberbanding
* Being interrupted while casting Shadow Form or Shroud of Distress by Djinn. You don't need Shadow Form up unless there are Ice Elementals. Sliver Armor can help prevent interrupts.

